params:query {
  ~from: 2026-08-01
  ~to: 2026-08-31
}

docs {
  # Get Dividends Calendar

  Returns all dividend calendar entries from the local database.

  Without filters, returns the most recent 200 records ordered by ex-date descending.

  ## Query Parameters (optional)

  | Param | Description |
  |-------|-------------|
  | from  | Start ex-date filter (inclusive), YYYY-MM-DD |
  | to    | End ex-date filter (inclusive), YYYY-MM-DD |

  ## Response Shape

  ```json
  {
    "as_of": "2026-08-05T00:00:00+08:00",
    "total": 42,
    "dividends": [ ... ]
  }
  ```

  ## Example

  `GET /dividends?from=2026-08-01&to=2026-08-31`
}
